WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Start PCRC on Windows, compare the pairing codes, and keep the selected computer online.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Open Customize > MCP, choose Open .cursor/mcp.json, and enter the PCRC server URL.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Choose OAuth and Connect pcrc. Sign in to the account that owns the computer.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Enable PCRC tools in Agent. Try a read-only request and check the result.
